# Laboratory Patient Flow

## 0. Overview

This file is the direct Laboratory flow source of truth for HOSSPI HMS. Lab is an **executing department** â" every order links to a **clinical encounter** (`encounter_id`). Lab does not create OPD/IPD encounters or advance patient flow stages directly; orchestrators update OPD/IPD stages when work completes. Align with [`.cursor/flows/opd-flow.mdc`](./opd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/ipd-flow.mdc`](./ipd-flow.mdc), and [`.cursor/app-write-up.mdc`](../app-write-up.mdc).

## 1. Goal

Enable lab staff to execute sample-to-result workflows: receive orders, collect samples, process tests, enter and verify results, handle QC, and release results to clinicians â" with billing integration at order time and encounter traceability on every row.

### Central encounter rule

Orders attach to OPD or IPD encounters. Lab executes and reports â" Clinical/Doctor places orders via shared clinical actions; OPD/IPD orchestrators own stage progression.

